 =========================================================================
                                 - About -
 =========================================================================

 This is the most beautiful text adder you've ever seen :)
 It's only a beta release but works 100% except that it
 won't strip ads as it says it does on it's output.
 It handles everything in memory making it fast as lightning
 and it cleans up after itself good to make sure your
 memory is intact and not a mess wich is the case
 with AirAdder all versions.




 =========================================================================
                        - Installing S-Adder v3.3 -
 =========================================================================


 This is a simple textadder.. just install it!







